  dialogues:
  - text: GOOD MORNING.
    isMother: 0
  - text: CAN I SEE YOUR BABY?
    isMother: 0
  - text: Sure
    isMother: 1
  - text: SEE?
    isMother: 0
  - text: Your baby is perfectly healthy even without vaccines.
    isMother: 0
  - text: HE DOES LOOK HEALTHY.
    isMother: 1
  - text: EXACTLY.
    isMother: 0
  - text: ' I don''t think you should rush vaccination.'
    isMother: 0
  - text: babies don't need it if they're already healthy.
    isMother: 0
  - text: But the nurse said vaccines help protect babies from diseases.
    isMother: 1
